# Kiosk settings for a Caldecote card, merged into /etc/default/pitchtribe-kiosk
# by deploy/club-content.sh when this line is installed or flashed.
#
# Without this line the card boots, serves the wall correctly at /feeds/clubhouse
# — and opens /player instead, which on a card with no playlist is an empty
# screen. The wall becomes a page nobody in the building ever opens.
#
# The leading "/" matters: it means "a path on whatever server this kiosk is
# already pointed at". The installer has written that origin by the time this is
# read, so a card served by its own Pi and a card served by a hub both end up
# pointing at the right place. Writing a full http:// URL here instead would
# pin every Caldecote card at one host.
PITCHTRIBE_URL=/feeds/clubhouse
